changed=stage removed
descriptors=[]
explanation=A stream stage is removed: `filter`, `distinct`, `sorted`, `limit`, `skip`, `dropWhile` or `takeWhile`, and the stream goes on without it. It goes unnoticed when no test has input the stage would change.
id=stream/remove-stage
methods=[distinct, dropWhile, filter, limit, skip, sorted, takeWhile]
owners=[java.util.stream.DoubleStream, java.util.stream.IntStream, java.util.stream.LongStream, java.util.stream.Stream]
rewrite=remove
since=0
source=
templates={headline=no test needs `.{name}(…)` in {method}, headline.distinct=no test has duplicates for `.distinct()` in {method} to remove, headline.limit=no test has more elements than `.limit(…)` in {method} lets through, headline.skip=no test has an element `.skip(…)` in {method} must leave out, headline.sorted=no test checks the order `.sorted()` gives in {method}, help=add a test where `.{name}(…)` must leave elements out, and assert which, help.distinct=add a test with a repeated element, and assert it comes back once, help.filter=add a test with an element the filter must drop, and assert it's gone, help.limit=add a test with more elements than the limit, and assert only the first come back, help.skip=add a test with elements before the skip point, and assert they're left out, help.sorted=add a test whose input is out of order, and assert the order of the result}
tier=defaults

changed=changed to {to}
descriptors=[]
explanation=`anyMatch`, `allMatch` and `noneMatch` swap places. It goes unnoticed when no test has input where some elements match and some don't.
id=stream/swap-match
methods=[allMatch, anyMatch, noneMatch]
owners=[java.util.stream.DoubleStream, java.util.stream.IntStream, java.util.stream.LongStream, java.util.stream.Stream]
rewrite=rename anyMatch->allMatch, anyMatch->noneMatch, allMatch->anyMatch, noneMatch->anyMatch
since=0
source=
templates={headline=no test tells `{name}` from `{to}` in {method}, help=use input where some but not all elements match, and assert the result}
tier=defaults
